review/shots/
review/test/
review/audit/
review/frame-*.jpg
review/lf-*.jpg
review/lf-yavg.txt
review/yavg.txt
review/verify-*.jpg
review/ground-raw.jpg
review/logo-end-frame.jpg

# never ship the zip
*.zip

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Deliberately tracked, do not add these to the ignore list:
#   review/design-package.md            the build's input document
#   review/hero-logo-raw.mp4            the raw hero generation (54 credits)
#   review/hero-scrub-braid-backup.mp4  the earlier approved hero, kept as a revert option
#   review/logo-start-frame.png         the start frame (2 credits)
#   review/logo-end-frame.png           the locally composited logo end frame
#   review/mark.png                     the brand mark source used to build it
#   review/hero-raw.mp4                 the braid hero's raw generation (54 credits)
#   review/start-frame.png              the braid hero's start frame (2 credits)
